  "2026-09-05T10:20:49.596Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status seen_item_ids _workspace search returned zero matches. Complete corpus title review and full closed pm-b0v8fs metadata establish earlier capacity-overflow remediation, not this reserved-identity producer defect. Current open/in-progress ownership lists were inspected before creating this distinct recurrence."
  "2026-09-05T10:24:57.225Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: workspace activity, blank, spaced and oversized identities made the generated next_state fail the unchanged parser. The producer now retains only parser-valid item ids while preserving all non-item rows in the actual response. Thirty-two focused tests pass, including valid-reference suppression and existing capacity behavior."
  "2026-09-05T10:37:34.450Z","harness:codex","Verification: output-session regression and existing contracts pass 32 tests. Regenerated calibration checks all 2243 requested rows, where the old fixture silently read 1998. Session output bytes improve from 39024 to 38778 at the large tier and workspace pseudo-identities no longer enter seen_item_ids; calibration budgets are unchanged."
  "2026-09-05T10:39:16.642Z","harness:codex","Installed-artifact acceptance: npm pack of this checkout installed independently with npm and Bun in disposable directories. Both completed 21 CLI operations including parent and children reads, exact duplicate parity, claim/update/comments/notes/learnings/files, linked public-SDK acceptance in explicit tracker sandbox context, structured close/release and clean history validation. Public SDK verified three complete items, duplicate analysis, 10000 candidate rows sampled to 256, final delivery validation and physical ledger ceiling. Local npx and bunx execute version 2026.9.5 in both installations. No real tracker was used by these tests."
  "2026-09-05T11:14:17.524Z","harness:codex","Delivery verification: full sandbox coverage passes 8442 tests in 613 files, exact 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered (59977 lines, 62381 statements, 12941 functions, 47268 branches). Full quality:static, package-artifact and documentation-link gates pass. Every linked test on all six active owners passes through pm test --run --progress. npm and Bun installed-artifact acceptance passes 21 CLI operations each with public SDK assertions, npx and bunx. GitHub has no open issues, existing PRs or open dependency/code/secret security alerts; dependency audit is clean. Review and exact-head hosted checks remain the next delivery step."
  "2026-09-05T11:20:08.986Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1199 contains the combined 52-file SDK/CLI implementation, contracts, tests, documentation and generated changelog. Implementation commit 2cbfbda7c carries passing local full coverage and quality evidence. Use scripts/reviews/pr-review-loop.mjs watch --pr 1199 --repo unbraind/pm-cli --interval 60, inspect all paginated comments/reviews/threads including updatedAt changes, react and reply on the actual surface, and require exact-head hosted analyzer proof before merge. This comment records review routing, not approval or publication."
